# Worked example

A single annotated sentence, shown at all three levels with the **complete tags**
LingFine produces, then as it exports. This is one illustrative record; the full
corpus is not published.

> **ọ́ nà èrí ńrī** — "He eats"
> (lemma layer: *ó nà È-rí ńrí*)

Every surface tone mark is **derived**, not merely recorded. The full feature
strings below show the lexical value, the realised value, the licensing
environment, and the mapping operation for each unit.

## 1. Sentence level

The grammatical environment that licenses everything below it.

| Feature | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Clause type | Main |
| Force | Declarative |
| Polarity | Affirmative |
| Aspect | Present progressive |
| Focus | No |

## 2. Token level

Four tokens. Each row summarises; the full tag for every token follows.

| # | Form | Lemma | POS | Tone (lex → real) | ATR |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | ọ́ | ó | PRON | Unsp → **H** | Minus |
| 2 | nà | nà | AUX | Unsp → **L** | Minus |
| 3 | èrí | rí | VERB (VWORD) | → **LH** | Plus |
| 4 | ńrī | ńrí | NOUN | HH → **HM** | Plus |

Full tags:

```
ọ́    PRON|PronType=Prs|Person=3|Number=Sing|Case=Nom|Tone=H|Tone_Lemma=Unsp|
      Tone_Role=Dep|ToneCtrl=Context.Force:Declarative|ATR=Minus|ATR_Role=Dep|
      ATRCtrl=VerbForm:Fin|ATRMap=Harmony|Context.Focus=No|Context.Polarity=Pos|
      Context.Force=Declarative

nà    AUX|VerbForm=Fin|Tense=Pres|Aspect=Prog|Mood=Ind|Polarity=Pos|Tone=L|
      Tone_Lemma=Unsp|Tone_Role=Dep|
      ToneCtrl=Polarity:Pos+Context.Force:Declarative+ClauseType:Main|
      ATR=Minus|ATR_Role=Ctrl|ATRCtrl=self|Context.Force=Declarative|
      Context.Polarity=Pos|Context.Focus=No

èrí   VWORD|VerbForm=Part|Tense=Pres|Aspect=Prog|Mood=Ind|Polarity=Pos|
      SituationType=Dynamic|Tone=LH|ATR=Plus|ATRMap=Harmony|SVC=No|
      ClauseType=Main|Context.Force=Declarative|Context.Polarity=Pos|
      Context.Focus=No

ńrī   NOUN|Number=Sing|Case=Acc|Tone=HM|Tone_Lemma=HH|Tone_Role=Dep|
